%N A058925 Number of independent dominating sets in labeled trees with n nodes.
%C A058925 Independent dominating sets are also called maximal independent vertex sets. - _Andrew Howroyd_, Oct 14 2026
%H A058925 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A058925/b058925.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A058925 Changwoo Lee, <a href="https://doi.org/10.4134/CKMS.2003.18.1.181">The number of independent dominating sets of labeled trees</a>, Commun. Korean Math. Soc. 18 (2003), 181-192. See p. 189.
%H A058925 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/MaximalIndependentVertexSet.html">Maximal Independent Vertex Set</a>.
%F A058925 a(n) = A058924(n) / n. - _Sean A. Irvine_, Sep 05 2022
%o A058925 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=w=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t1=x*exp(v), t2=x*exp(u+v)); u=x*exp(v+w); v=t2-t1; w=t1); Vec(serlaplace(intformal((u + v)/x)))} \\ _Andrew Howroyd_, Oct 14 2026
%Y A058925 Cf. A058924 (rooted), A399451 (independent only), A399452 (dominating only).
